# What the image installs besides cmapi's own dependencies, which pyproject.toml pins. cmapi/lock.sh resolves this file with
# pyproject.toml into requirements.txt, the hashed lock that the Containerfile installs with --require-hashes (#655).
#
# The build backend of pyproject.toml's [build-system]: the Containerfile builds cmapi with --no-build-isolation, so the
# backend comes from the lock, hashed, and not from an unhashed download at build time. Keep the bound equal to [build-system].
